        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ping maknga tatro abumaeng",
            "Khou tei Zion chingru khou tei;",
            "He! Ching tei thing Kros tei nang zau loi",
            "Khou tei Poubaomei ta thaengluai",
            "Kapumh nthan mei kazei luang.",
            "",
            "2. He Kalvary ching kauh mei khou,",
            "Charin tuang kanlou mei hou e;",
            "Kandih kun padeih mei guai rui,",
            "Theihmei guai zinghmei khou bam e,",
            "Zing kandiu chingh tei gaan puni,",
            "Tingsaeng zaeng kata hou puni.",
            "",
            "3. Khaeng loumei zam tei zau khang rui,",
            "Kata karana ganlouna",
            "Kapi nkhum keimei zau khang",
            "Katana ntanga damlou,",
            "Gunh kumna khiu ‘phuan khangni nai,",
            "Lumlou makmei guai khang hamh e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
